#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:149
msgid "Virtual axis"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:151
msgid ""
"Each combination in a matrix is called a `ProjectRow`; and a ProjectRow is "
"represented as a sequence of `VirtualAxis`."
msgstr ""
"マトリックスの各組み合わせは `ProjectRow` と呼ばれ、"
"ProjectRow は、`VirtualAxis` の列によって構成されている。"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:162
msgid ""
"/**\n"
"   * WeakAxis allows a row to depend on another row with Zero value.\n"
"   * For example, Scala version can be Zero for Java project, and it's ok.\n"
"   */"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:168
msgid ""
"/** StrongAxis requires a row to depend on another row with the same "
"selected value. */"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:173
msgid ""
"VirtualAxis splits into `WeakAxis` and `StrongAxis`. Scala version is an "
"example of a weak axis where a row with a Scala version can depend on "
"another Java row without a Scala version. Meanwhile, the platform is a "
"strong axis where a row can depend on another only if the platform matches "
"exactly."
msgstr ""
"VirtualAxis はさらに、`WeakAxis` と `StrongAxis` に分岐する。"
"Scala バージョンは、弱い軸の例で、ある Scala バージョンを持つ列は、"
"Scala バージョンを持たない Java の列に依存することができる。"
"一方、同一のプラットフォーム間でしか依存することができないため、プラットフォームは強い軸として定義される。"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:175
msgid "For example, we can define SparkAxis as follows:"
msgstr "例えば、SparkAxis は以下のように定義できる:"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:177
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"project/Axis.scala\"\n"
"```scala\n"
"import sbt.*\n"
"\n"
"case class SparkAxis(idSuffix: String, directorySuffix: String)\n"
"  extends VirtualAxis.WeakAxis\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:186
msgid ""
"See [Cross building on a virtual axis](../recipes/virtual-axis.md) recipe "
"for the details on how to use `SparkAxis`."
msgstr ""
"具体的な `SparkAxis` の使用方法に関しては "
"[VirtualAxis に対するクロスビルド](../recipes/virtual-axis.md)のレシピ参照。"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:188
msgid "Publishing convention"
msgstr "公開規約"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:191
msgid ""
"We use the Scala ABI (application binary interface) version as suffix to "
"denote which version of Scala was used to compile a library. For example, "
"the artifact name `cats-effect_2.13` means Scala 2.13.x was used. `cats-"
"effect_3` means Scala 3.x was used. This fairly simple approach allows "
"interoperability with users of Maven, Ant and other build tools. For pre-"
"prelease versions of Scala, such as 2.13.0-RC1, full version will be "
"considered the ABI version."
msgstr ""
"ライブラリのコンパイルに使用した Scala のバージョンを示すため、Scala ABI（ア"
"プリケーションバイナリインターフェース）バージョンをサフィックスとして使用す"
"る。例えば、アーティファクト名 `cats-effect_2.13` は Scala 2.13.x が使用され"
"たことを意味し、`cats-effect_3` は Scala 3.x が使用されたことを意味する。この"
"シンプルな方式で Maven、Ant などのビルドツールユーザーとの相互運用が可能であ"
"る。2.13.0-RC1 のようなプレリリース版の Scala では、フルバージョンが ABI バー"
"ジョンとして扱われる。"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:193
msgid ""
"`crossVersion` setting can be used to override the publishing convention:"
msgstr "`crossVersion` セッティングで公開規約をオーバーライドできる:"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:195
msgid "`CrossVersion.disabled` (no suffix)"
msgstr "`CrossVersion.disabled`（サフィックスなし）"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:196
msgid "`CrossVersion.binary` (`_<scala-abi-version>`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:197
msgid "`CrossVersion.full` (`_<scala-version>`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:199
msgid ""
"The default is either `CrossVersion.binary` or `CrossVersion.disabled` "
"depending on the value of `crossPaths`. Because (unlike Scala library) Scala "
"compiler is not forward compatible among the patch releases, compiler "
"plugins should use `CrossVersion.full`."
msgstr ""
"デフォルト値は `crossPaths` に応じて `CrossVersion.binary` または "
"`CrossVersion.disabled` に設定される。ただし、Scala 標準ライブラリと異なり "
"Scala コンパイラはパッチリリース間で前方互換性がないため、コンパイラプラグイ"
"ンは `CrossVersion.full` を採用することが推奨される。"
